![Image 6: Ancient warriors are depicted in an engraved battle scene, with some on horseback and others tending to the wounded](https://europe.factsanddetails.com/archives/001/202311/d1e0bcdb64de73f9.jpg)

Hannibal at the Battle of Cannae

